87 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E (Machine learning automates the step from vibration features to a decision. Reviews describe a pipeline of feature extraction, feature selection and a classifier or anomaly detector. Deep learning can learn features directly from raw signals, but systematic reviews note that near-perfect accuracies on laboratory test rigs often fail to carry over to real critical machinery, mainly because labelled fault data is scarce and models are hard to interpret. Anomaly detection, which learns only what normal looks like, suits industrial settings where healthy data is plentiful and failures are rare.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
